<tr><td>The teaching is given to X &ldquo;and some say&rdquo; to Y</td><td>Both were believable authors, so they are close in role and time</td><td><span class="tag warn">counted, not checked</span></td></tr>
<tr><td>X objects to Y, X rules like Y</td><td>X is at or after Y</td><td><span class="tag warn">undercounted</span> the verb comes first and I only looked between names</td></tr>
